              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kut 41:40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ahabw'okuba ogwo Muyudaaya Morodekai niwe yaabaire ari owa kabiri aha mugabe Ahasuero; kandi akaba ari rugambwa omu Bayudaaya, naasiimwa beene waabo boona, ahabw'okuba akaba asherurira eihanga rye eby'okurikiza, kandi n'okwendeza abantu be obusingye.",
          "type": "text",
